<title>TURKEY: Turk Is Leasing secures $29 mln syndicated loan.</title>
<headline>Turk Is Leasing secures $29 mln syndicated loan.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turkey's Is Leasing secured a $29-million syndicated loan from a nine-bank consortium, led by Sanwa, it said in a statement on Monday.</p>
<p>The two-year loan will be used to finance the company's leasing transcactions.</p>
<p>Is Leasing, owned by Isbank, did not disclose pricing of the deal. But banking sources say the facility was priced at around 150 basis points over LIBOR.</p>
</text>
